    {
      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"16\" type=\"會\">16 菩薩見實會</cb:mulu><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"19\" type=\"品\">19 諸梵天等授記品</cb:mulu><cb:div type=\"hui\">\r\n<milestone n=\"68\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b01\">0385b01</span><cb:div type=\"pin\">\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b02\">0385b02</span><cb:juan n=\"068\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"068\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷<anchor xml:id=\"fxT11p0385b01\"/>第六十八</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b03\">0385b03</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b04\">0385b04</span><byline cb:type=\"Translator\"><anchor xml:id=\"fxT11p0385b02\"/>北齊三藏那連提耶舍譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b05\">0385b05</span><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"20\" type=\"品\">20 光音天得授記品</cb:mulu><head>菩薩見實會第十六之八光音<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0385002\">天＋（等）【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0385002\">天【大】，天等【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0385002\"><p class=\"lg\">天</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">天等</rdg></app>得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b06\">0385b06</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0385003\">授＝受【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0385003\">授【大】，受【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0385003\"><p class=\"lg\">授</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">受</rdg></app>記品第二十</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b07\">0385b07</span><p>爾時五十八千萬光音諸天，見諸阿修羅、<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0385004\">伽＝迦【明】下同</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0385004\">伽【大】下同，迦【明】下同</span><app n=\"0385004\"><p class=\"lg\">伽</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">迦</rdg></app>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b08\">0385b08</span>樓羅乃至梵天等供養如來，聞授記已，欣喜\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b09\">0385b09</span>踊躍皆得稱心，偏袒右肩右膝著地，向佛合\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b10\">0385b10</span>掌恭敬作禮，白佛言：「世尊！有三昧名照耀一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b11\">0385b11</span>切法，若菩薩摩訶薩學是三昧，一切法中悉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b12\">0385b12</span>得光明，得入菩薩法門。菩薩摩訶薩解了知\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b13\">0385b13</span>已，得無邊辯、無礙辯、相續辯、種種辯、美妙辯、真\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b14\">0385b14</span>善辯、相應辯、解脫辯、微細辯、不共辯、甚深辯，乃\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b15\">0385b15</span>至得於如來之辯。世尊！何者名為照耀一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b16\">0385b16</span>法三昧？菩薩入此諸法門故，念諸覺觀知一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b17\">0385b17</span>切法無覺離覺，是無覺法遍一切處，無有一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b18\">0385b18</span>法能覺察者。何以故？性自離故。若法無性，云\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b19\">0385b19</span>何能覺知一切法？無其覺已，入阿字門，得上\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b20\">0385b20</span>辯才。彼菩薩入阿字門已，得無邊辯。阿字無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b21\">0385b21</span>邊、阿字非普遍、阿字無作、阿字非有為、阿字\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b22\">0385b22</span>非成就、阿字非事、阿字無所依、阿字無動\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b23\">0385b23</span>轉、阿字非略、阿字非廣、阿字非分別、阿字\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b24\">0385b24</span>非眾事成、阿字不可穿、阿字非色、阿字不可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b25\">0385b25</span>示、阿字不可觀、阿字無有能見者、阿字非可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b26\">0385b26</span>思、阿字不定住、阿字非可知、阿字非能知、阿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b27\">0385b27</span>字非可測、阿字不能自示現、阿字亦不能示\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b28\">0385b28</span>他、阿字非思議、阿字不去、阿字不來、阿字非\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385b29\">0385b29</span>近、阿字非遠、阿字非言說、阿字亦非可說法、\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c01\">0385c01</span>阿字非名、阿字非用、阿字非現前、阿字非覆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c02\">0385c02</span>障、阿字非移轉、阿字非可改、阿字非差別、阿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c03\">0385c03</span>字無二、阿字非生、阿字非虛妄、阿字非真實、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c04\">0385c04</span>阿字不可說、阿字非生滅、阿字非清淨、阿字\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c05\">0385c05</span>亦非可淨法、阿字非執持、阿字非攝他、阿字\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c06\">0385c06</span>非棄捨、阿字不為他法作、阿字亦不作他法、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c07\">0385c07</span>阿字不生、阿字不滅、阿字不能生他法亦復\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c08\">0385c08</span>不能滅諸法、阿字非生非不生、阿字不與生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c09\">0385c09</span>法作生因亦復不作不生緣、阿字非依非不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c10\">0385c10</span>依、阿字非假非不假、阿字非却非不却、阿字\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c11\">0385c11</span>非許非不許、阿字非可得亦非不可得、阿字\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c12\">0385c12</span>非空非不空、阿字非分別非不分別、阿字非\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c13\">0385c13</span>相非不相、阿字非願非不願。世尊！一切諸法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c14\">0385c14</span>皆如是相，所謂無相。一切諸法皆同一實，所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c15\">0385c15</span>謂無實。皆同一趣，所謂無趣。皆同一入，所謂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c16\">0385c16</span>無入。皆同一假，所謂無假。皆同一用，所謂無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c17\">0385c17</span>用。一切諸法皆同一說，所謂無說。世尊！諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c18\">0385c18</span>法無起，不可得故。諸法非有，以無有故。諸法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c19\">0385c19</span>無生，以不生故。諸法無滅，以不滅故。無為法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c20\">0385c20</span>者，無有作故。世尊！一切<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0385005\">（諸）＋法【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0385005\">法【大】＊，諸法【明】＊</span><app n=\"0385005\"><p class=\"lg\">法</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">諸法</rdg></app>皆同一如，當如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c21\">0385c21</span>是知。世尊！是諸不生法，彼法事用云何得知？\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c22\">0385c22</span>世尊！譬如有人夢中所作，當知諸法亦復如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c23\">0385c23</span>是。何以故？夢所作事，不生不<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0385006\">起＝趣【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0385006\">起【大】，趣【宮】</span><app n=\"0385006\"><p class=\"lg\">起</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">趣</rdg></app>亦非有故。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c24\">0385c24</span>夢雖不實非無假名，說有夢作。一切諸法皆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c25\">0385c25</span>亦如是。世尊！譬如響聲唯有假名，諸法但假\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c26\">0385c26</span>亦復如是。世尊！喻若幻人但是假名，當知諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c27\">0385c27</span>法亦復如是。世尊！譬如陽炎但假名字，諸法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c28\">0385c28</span>假名亦復如是。世尊！如鏡中像但有名用，當\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0385c29\">0385c29</span>知諸法亦復如是。世尊！為悅豫凡愚說有夢\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a01\">0386a01</span>事，夢中所作皆非真實，響幻炎影亦復如是，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a02\">0386a02</span>但有假名皆無實作。世尊！我等如是解知如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a03\">0386a03</span>來所說法義。」</p><p>爾時光音諸天以偈讚佛：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a04\">0386a04</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「世尊善知此法義，<caesura/>及餘種種無邊法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a05\">0386a05</span><p class=\"lg\">如來所有諸佛子，<caesura/>得父資財常遊戲。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a06\">0386a06</span><p class=\"lg\">世間少智莫能入，<caesura/>由常計著我心故，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a07\">0386a07</span><p class=\"lg\">十方求我不可得，<caesura/>我體本來性自空。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a08\">0386a08</span><p class=\"lg\">如空陽炎非實水，<caesura/>愚癡見彼作水想，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a09\">0386a09</span><p class=\"lg\">都由無智生<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386001\">迷＝悉【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386001\">迷【大】，悉【聖】</span><app n=\"0386001\"><p class=\"lg\">迷</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">悉</rdg></app>惑，<caesura/>虛妄顛倒計我人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a10\">0386a10</span><p class=\"lg\">彼癡愚惑如來教，<caesura/>是故不解深義趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a11\">0386a11</span><p class=\"lg\">凡夫心識如炎水，<caesura/>不能了知諸陰義，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a12\">0386a12</span><p class=\"lg\">心樂生死著苦箭，<caesura/>諸根<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386002\">駃＝駛【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386002\">駛【CB】【磧乙-CB】【宋】【元】【明】【宮】，駃【大】</span><app n=\"0386002\"><p class=\"lg\">駛<note type=\"cf1\">QC015n0023_p0532b14</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">駃</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">駛</rdg></app>流所漂溺。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a13\">0386a13</span><p class=\"lg\">斯等畢竟無自性，<caesura/>為癡覆蔽妄受苦，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a14\">0386a14</span><p class=\"lg\">彼皆失智心迷亂，<caesura/>於諸苦中生樂想。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a15\">0386a15</span><p class=\"lg\">心常顛倒順三毒，<caesura/>是諸煩惱甚可怖，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a16\">0386a16</span><p class=\"lg\">貪欲瞋恚及愚癡，<caesura/>斯諸結使常隨逐。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a17\">0386a17</span><p class=\"lg\">深樂受故生渴愛，<caesura/>愚癡不識故受苦，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a18\">0386a18</span><p class=\"lg\">無智隨順諸煩惱，<caesura/>如人癡負怨家行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a19\">0386a19</span><p class=\"lg\">聞佛所說空教門，<caesura/>於空反畏失解脫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a20\">0386a20</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如怯人執持刀，<caesura/>應得安隱反生畏。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a21\">0386a21</span><p class=\"lg\">大智世尊所說法，<caesura/>謂是微妙阿字門，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a22\">0386a22</span><p class=\"lg\">能生真實勝智慧，<caesura/>猶如平地生大樹。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a23\">0386a23</span><p class=\"lg\">降諸魔怨那由眾，<caesura/>能<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386003\">寤＝悟【元】【明】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386003\">寤【大】＊，悟【元】【明】＊</span><app n=\"0386003\"><p class=\"lg\">寤</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">悟</rdg></app>安隱妙菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a24\">0386a24</span><p class=\"lg\">以彼八正大船栰，<caesura/>於諸有海度群生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a25\">0386a25</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊所有諸佛子，<caesura/>了知如來勝教法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a26\">0386a26</span><p class=\"lg\">速滅煩惱諸怨敵，<caesura/>疾證無上大菩提。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a27\">0386a27</span><p class=\"lg\">既自解脫離毒心，<caesura/>見餘毒者施智藥，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a28\">0386a28</span><p class=\"lg\">得到究竟彼岸果，<caesura/>獲大安樂無為處。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386a29\">0386a29</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法皆悉空，<caesura/>諸餘外論妄分別，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b01\">0386b01</span><p class=\"lg\">明人棄惡就正路，<caesura/>皆由本來久修學。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b02\">0386b02</span><p class=\"lg\">心無所著即解脫，<caesura/>諸法體性自如是，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b03\">0386b03</span><p class=\"lg\">彼能如是了知者，<caesura/>成佛大力那羅延。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b04\">0386b04</span><p class=\"lg\">無有繫縛及縛者，<caesura/>諸法性空皆亦無，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b05\">0386b05</span><p class=\"lg\">真如寂滅及非如，<caesura/>非是垢穢亦非淨。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b06\">0386b06</span><p class=\"lg\">煩惱無相亦無斷，<caesura/>以其本來性自空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b07\">0386b07</span><p class=\"lg\">如是能知真實法，<caesura/>彼人當得一切智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b08\">0386b08</span><p class=\"lg\">自證解脫復度他，<caesura/>此等不生亦不滅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b09\">0386b09</span><p class=\"lg\">世間天人皆迷惑，<caesura/>如春禽獸見炎水。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b10\">0386b10</span><p class=\"lg\">虛妄分別起<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386004\">渴＝濁【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386004\">渴【大】，濁【聖】</span><app n=\"0386004\"><p class=\"lg\">渴</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">濁</rdg></app>心，<caesura/>想見男女受苦惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b11\">0386b11</span><p class=\"lg\">以業種種生諸趣，<caesura/>由心作故有差別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b12\">0386b12</span><p class=\"lg\">造業有報及以受，<caesura/>彼業無有能作者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b13\">0386b13</span><p class=\"lg\">我等如是解佛法，<caesura/>是諸如來妙境界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b14\">0386b14</span><p class=\"lg\">是故如來心調伏，<caesura/>諸根寂靜能忍辱。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b15\">0386b15</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊如法得供養，<caesura/>清淨無垢盡諸穢，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b16\">0386b16</span><p class=\"lg\">具足眾德離闇冥，<caesura/>唯佛能施三界眼。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b17\">0386b17</span><p class=\"lg\">我今讚佛所獲福，<caesura/>唯有出世大導師，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b18\">0386b18</span><p class=\"lg\">二足世尊功德聚，<caesura/>能知我等所得報。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b19\">0386b19</span><p class=\"lg\">以此微妙勝善根，<caesura/>迴施一切諸群生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b20\">0386b20</span><p class=\"lg\">願彼當於未來世，<caesura/>悉得成就一切智。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b21\">0386b21</span><p>爾時世尊知光音天深信心已，及知修行辯\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b22\">0386b22</span>才具足，欲令大眾功德善根當復漸漸勝進\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b23\">0386b23</span>增長故，是時如來即現微笑。爾時慧命馬勝\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b24\">0386b24</span>即以偈頌問世尊曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b25\">0386b25</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「大悲善逝非無因，<caesura/>而現希有微笑相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b26\">0386b26</span><p class=\"lg\">能利世間無上士，<caesura/>正覺智慧超群生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b27\">0386b27</span><p class=\"lg\">兩足世尊功德聚，<caesura/>憐愍眾生願演說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b28\">0386b28</span><p class=\"lg\">為誰而現此微笑，<caesura/>殊勝光顯於世間？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386b29\">0386b29</span><p class=\"lg\">一切眾生若得聞，<caesura/>心意決定大喜悅，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c01\">0386c01</span><p class=\"lg\">修行善業證佛果，<caesura/>得離生死到涅槃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c02\">0386c02</span><p class=\"lg\">斯諸世間天人眾，<caesura/>生死苦惱之所逼，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c03\">0386c03</span><p class=\"lg\">願度群生於有海，<caesura/>演說八正大船路。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c04\">0386c04</span><p class=\"lg\">如是得<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386005\">聞＝間【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386005\">聞【大】，間【聖】</span><app n=\"0386005\"><p class=\"lg\">聞</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">間</rdg></app>大仙說，<caesura/>具八功德最勝道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c05\">0386c05</span><p class=\"lg\">世間於是生欣喜，<caesura/>樂修諸善願成佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c06\">0386c06</span><p class=\"lg\">勇猛精進有大力，<caesura/>內心清淨離諸疑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c07\">0386c07</span><p class=\"lg\">當傳如來所說法，<caesura/>是佛真子順聖教。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c08\">0386c08</span><p class=\"lg\">此諸眾會無餘念，<caesura/>一心瞻仰大瞿曇，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c09\">0386c09</span><p class=\"lg\">唯願敷演授記事，<caesura/>令其決斷疑惑心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c10\">0386c10</span><p class=\"lg\">合掌恭敬正意住，<caesura/>咸皆願樂欲聽聞，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c11\">0386c11</span><p class=\"lg\">善哉願說甘露味，<caesura/>諸有渴法<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386006\">明註曰當宋南藏作能</span>當得飲。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c12\">0386c12</span><p class=\"lg\">是等一切諸會眾，<caesura/>心淨愛樂勝功德，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c13\">0386c13</span><p class=\"lg\">瞻仰如來最勝顏，<caesura/>猶如嬰兒觀母面。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c14\">0386c14</span><p class=\"lg\">大慧願授此天記，<caesura/>開現微笑因緣事，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c15\">0386c15</span><p class=\"lg\">得聞如來授記已，<caesura/>世間當獲大利益。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c16\">0386c16</span><p class=\"lg\">誰於牟尼增善根，<caesura/>及以發願得滿足，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c17\">0386c17</span><p class=\"lg\">剋獲微妙功德藏，<caesura/>我今樂聞彼受記。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c18\">0386c18</span><p class=\"lg\">大眾必生欣喜心，<caesura/>聞佛所說授記故，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c19\">0386c19</span><p class=\"lg\">決定當具念慧力，<caesura/>及得修行三昧定。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c20\">0386c20</span><p>爾時世尊即以偈答慧命馬勝言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c21\">0386c21</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「善哉馬勝所問事，<caesura/>辯才應機正是時。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c22\">0386c22</span><p class=\"lg\">斯即如來神通力，<caesura/>以是汝今生智慧，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c23\">0386c23</span><p class=\"lg\">為利世間<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386007\">故＝成【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386007\">故【大】，成【宮】</span><app n=\"0386007\"><p class=\"lg\">故</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">成</rdg></app>增辯，<caesura/>是故汝今能致問。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c24\">0386c24</span><p class=\"lg\">我今為彼說授記，<caesura/>寂靜諸根一心聽。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c25\">0386c25</span><p class=\"lg\">此諸勝慧光音天，<caesura/>過去已供無量佛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c26\">0386c26</span><p class=\"lg\">見是世間孤無救，<caesura/>發心安住欲作佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c27\">0386c27</span><p class=\"lg\">修治真實微妙行，<caesura/>必定當成一切智，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c28\">0386c28</span><p class=\"lg\">為求佛道諸眾生，<caesura/>如迷失徑教正路。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0386c29\">0386c29</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386008\">如＝見【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0386008\">如【大】，見【宮】</span><app n=\"0386008\"><p class=\"lg\">如</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">見</rdg></app>是得聞世尊教，<caesura/>其聲最勝無等等，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a01\">0387a01</span><p class=\"lg\">樂佛功德智慧人，<caesura/>必得究竟到彼岸。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a02\">0387a02</span><p class=\"lg\">彼有智力知<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387001\">善惡＝善根【三】【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387001\">善惡【大】，善根【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0387001\"><p class=\"lg\">善惡</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【聖】\">善根</rdg></app>，<caesura/>決定當獲佛菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a03\">0387a03</span><p class=\"lg\">欣喜已發菩提願，<caesura/>如婦生男稱其心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a04\">0387a04</span><p class=\"lg\">此天為求菩提者，<caesura/>示其出世真正路，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a05\">0387a05</span><p class=\"lg\">於不可說那由劫，<caesura/>修習菩薩勝妙行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a06\">0387a06</span><p class=\"lg\">所化眾生過眾星，<caesura/>安置於佛菩提已，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a07\">0387a07</span><p class=\"lg\">當來具足世間解，<caesura/>自然成就一切智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a08\">0387a08</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等妙土不可說，<caesura/>世界寬廣有百億，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a09\">0387a09</span><p class=\"lg\">是諸妙剎甚清淨，<caesura/>無量種種勝莊嚴。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a10\">0387a10</span><p class=\"lg\">彼佛國土諸眾生，<caesura/>無三惡趣及八難，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a11\">0387a11</span><p class=\"lg\">一切皆發菩提心，<caesura/>咸各得住不退轉。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a12\">0387a12</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸如來國土中，<caesura/>亦復無有小乘法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a13\">0387a13</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生悉皆求佛道，<caesura/>便得進趣不退地。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a14\">0387a14</span><p class=\"lg\">是諸剎土眾生類，<caesura/>一切壽命悉齊等，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a15\">0387a15</span><p class=\"lg\">經於十億恒沙劫，<caesura/>皆由值遇諸佛故。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a16\">0387a16</span><p class=\"lg\">若教那由剎眾生，<caesura/>悉得入於小涅槃，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a17\">0387a17</span><p class=\"lg\">若復有人化一人，<caesura/>或男或女入大乘。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a18\">0387a18</span><p class=\"lg\">初福比此功德聚，<caesura/>算數譬喻不能及，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a19\">0387a19</span><p class=\"lg\">是故若住大乘者，<caesura/>應當轉化於餘人。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a20\">0387a20</span><p class=\"lg\">馬勝！以是因緣故，<caesura/>如來出世甚為難，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a21\">0387a21</span><p class=\"lg\">猶如優曇極難值，<caesura/>無邊大智如是說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a22\">0387a22</span><p class=\"lg\">以巧深智善知識，<caesura/>善解方便示正路，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a23\">0387a23</span><p class=\"lg\">安隱無上勝菩提，<caesura/>若人求者應親近。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a24\">0387a24</span><p class=\"lg\">從佛口聞如是語，<caesura/>具足微妙甚深義，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a25\">0387a25</span><p class=\"lg\">一切大眾皆欣喜，<caesura/>踊躍充滿稱心意。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a26\">0387a26</span><p class=\"lg\">那由諸天住空中，<caesura/>皆散天衣旋轉下，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a27\">0387a27</span><p class=\"lg\">欣喜讚聲滿虛空：<caesura/>「敬禮無比大神力，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a28\">0387a28</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨妙智度世間，<caesura/>能滅眾生煩惱熱。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387a29\">0387a29</span><p class=\"lg\">佛說甘露滅三毒，<caesura/>如阿伽陀消眾毒，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b01\">0387b01</span><p class=\"lg\">得聞智慧斷諸結。<caesura/>世間迷惑多苦惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b02\">0387b02</span><p class=\"lg\">於其有趣當得脫，<caesura/>從佛得聞勝法故。」</p></lg></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b03\">0387b03</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"21\" type=\"品\">21 遍淨天授記品</cb:mulu><head>遍淨天授記品第二十一</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b04\">0387b04</span><p>爾時十二那由他遍淨諸天等，見諸阿修羅、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b05\">0387b05</span>伽樓羅乃至光音天等供養如來，聞授記已，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b06\">0387b06</span>欣喜踊躍皆得稱心，自現威力而白佛言：「世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b07\">0387b07</span>尊！有三昧名超過一切法。菩薩摩訶薩得是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b08\">0387b08</span>三昧已，於諸攀緣及一切事皆生樂受不生\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b09\">0387b09</span>苦受。假使於其地獄<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387002\">事＝道【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387002\">事【大】，道【聖】</span><app n=\"0387002\"><p class=\"lg\">事</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">道</rdg></app>中，受諸苦惱皆生樂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b10\">0387b10</span>想。或復於其畜生道中，受畜生報亦生樂想。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b11\">0387b11</span>或復餓鬼道中，受飢餓苦亦生樂想。或復於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b12\">0387b12</span>彼阿修羅道中，亦生樂想。或復人中所受諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b13\">0387b13</span>苦，亦起樂想不生苦想。假使截手及以截足\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b14\">0387b14</span>割耳劓鼻，或復鞭打杖刺入身，或復牢獄繫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b15\">0387b15</span>閉，或復倒懸，或復裁割猶如衣帛，或復裹繫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b16\">0387b16</span>及以束縛，或復切膾，或復鎚搗猶如甘蔗，或\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b17\">0387b17</span>復蹉蹹破如蘆葦，或復火燒如<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387003\">穌＝酥【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387003\">蘇【CB】【麗-CB】，穌【大】，酥【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0387003\"><p class=\"lg\">蘇<note type=\"cf1\">K06n0022_p0536b22</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">穌</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">酥</rdg></app>油炷，或\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b18\">0387b18</span>復然身<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387b1801\">喻【CB】【麗-CB】，踏【大】</span><app n=\"0387b1801\"><p class=\"lg\">喻<note type=\"cf1\">K06n0022_p0536b23</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">踏</rdg></app>若明炬，或與<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387004\">師子＝獅子【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387004\">師子【大】，獅子【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0387004\"><p class=\"lg\">師子</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">獅子</rdg></app>虎狼為食，或復\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b19\">0387b19</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387005\">釅醋＝嚴酢【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387005\">釅醋【大】，嚴酢【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0387005\"><p class=\"lg\">釅醋</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】 【聖】\">嚴酢</rdg></app>及以辛汁澆灌口鼻，或復蒸煮及以火\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b20\">0387b20</span>炙，或與狂象踐踏其身，或復挑目，或以鉾矟\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b21\">0387b21</span>穿刺高舉、假使瞋怒來截其首，如是一切悉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b22\">0387b22</span>生樂想。何以故？由彼菩薩於其長夜修菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b23\">0387b23</span>行時發如是願：『若有眾生施我食者，願彼一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b24\">0387b24</span>切得涅槃樂。若有與我洗浴身體禮拜奉迎\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b25\">0387b25</span>尊重供養，若有眾生罵辱於我，<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387006\">復有人＝是故陰【元】，或復有人【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387006\">復有人【大】，是故陰【元】，或復有人【明】</span><app n=\"0387006\"><p class=\"lg\">復有人</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】\">是故陰</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">或復有人</rdg></app><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387007\">〔人〕－【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387007\">人【大】，〔－〕【明】</span><app n=\"0387007\"><p class=\"lg\">人</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b26\">0387b26</span>讚歎於我，若有眾生鞭打斫刺奪我身命，願\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b27\">0387b27</span>彼一切得涅槃樂，乃至覺<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0386003\"><p class=\"lg\">寤</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">悟</rdg></app>無上菩提。』彼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b28\">0387b28</span>菩薩成就如是心、具足如是業亦復具足如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387b29\">0387b29</span>是願，於一切眾生皆起樂想，常能修集無間\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c01\">0387c01</span>不斷。以是業報故，得一切法樂善<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387008\">取＝最【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387008\">取【大】，最【明】</span><app n=\"0387008\"><p class=\"lg\">取</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">最</rdg></app>三昧。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c02\">0387c02</span>彼菩薩得此三昧時，不為眾魔之所動壞，亦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c03\">0387c03</span>不為魔事之所繫縛。當知是菩薩得五種自\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c04\">0387c04</span>在。何等為五？一者壽命自在，二者生自在，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c05\">0387c05</span>三者業自在，四者覺觀自在，五者眾具果報\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c06\">0387c06</span>自在。彼菩薩摩訶薩若欲過一生證阿耨多\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c07\">0387c07</span>羅三藐三菩提者，以彼三昧力故即便能得。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c08\">0387c08</span>若不樂速證無上菩提，能住無量阿僧祇劫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c09\">0387c09</span>度脫眾生。何以故？當知彼菩薩住於大乘，與\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c10\">0387c10</span>諸菩薩常為導師，攝受一切諸餘菩薩。是大\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c11\">0387c11</span>菩薩厭離諸趣，為眾生故亦復生於一切趣\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c12\">0387c12</span>中，究竟一切菩薩所學，為般若波羅蜜之所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c13\">0387c13</span>攝受，具足一切巧方便力，知諸魔業得法究\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c14\">0387c14</span>竟。彼諸菩薩承佛威神，於一切法皆得盡知。」</p><p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c15\">0387c15</span>爾時遍淨諸天即以偈頌讚世尊曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c16\">0387c16</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「我等一切遍淨天，<caesura/>於諸佛法皆盡知，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c17\">0387c17</span><p class=\"lg\">頭面歸敬天人師，<caesura/>諸根寂靜<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387009\">知＝如【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387009\">知【大】，如【明】</span><app n=\"0387009\"><p class=\"lg\">知</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">如</rdg></app>寂滅。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c18\">0387c18</span><p class=\"lg\">解了諸義智所供，<caesura/>已度生死牟尼尊，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c19\">0387c19</span><p class=\"lg\">我今讚歎大導師，<caesura/>能善導他非他導。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c20\">0387c20</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法性相非究竟，<caesura/>亦復無有依住處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c21\">0387c21</span><p class=\"lg\">如來善知妄想事，<caesura/>猶如幻師知幻術。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c22\">0387c22</span><p class=\"lg\">智人解了語言<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387010\">音＝事【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387010\">音【大】，事【聖】</span><app n=\"0387010\"><p class=\"lg\">音</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">事</rdg></app>，<caesura/>喻若深谷諸響聲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c23\">0387c23</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊如是善知見，<caesura/>一切世間天人等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c24\">0387c24</span><p class=\"lg\">無有眾生及以命，<caesura/>亦復無人無壽者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c25\">0387c25</span><p class=\"lg\">大智觀察一切想，<caesura/>了達眾想悉<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387011\">歸＝空【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387011\">歸【大】，空【聖】</span><app n=\"0387011\"><p class=\"lg\">歸</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">空</rdg></app>空。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c26\">0387c26</span><p class=\"lg\">二足世尊慈無等，<caesura/>恒常行慈不暫捨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c27\">0387c27</span><p class=\"lg\">一切世間諸天人，<caesura/>不能測知如來智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c28\">0387c28</span><p class=\"lg\">導師演說緣眾生，<caesura/>所謂慈心是<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387012\">善修＝善根【三】【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0387012\">善修【大】，善根【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0387012\"><p class=\"lg\">善修</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【聖】\">善根</rdg></app>，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0387c29\">0387c29</span><p class=\"lg\">了知一切諸眾生，<caesura/>無有眾生及命者。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a01\">0388a01</span><p class=\"lg\">我等於此無垢濁，<caesura/>其心清淨離疑惑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a02\">0388a02</span><p class=\"lg\">是故於佛勝智慧，<caesura/>應受供者<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388001\">令＝今【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388001\">令【大】，今【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0388001\"><p class=\"lg\">令</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】 【聖】\">今</rdg></app>供養。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a03\">0388a03</span><p class=\"lg\">於其十方世界中，<caesura/>求苦畢竟不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a04\">0388a04</span><p class=\"lg\">如來無上天中天，<caesura/>說於眾生起慈心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a05\">0388a05</span><p class=\"lg\">斯即是其世尊教，<caesura/>我今得解亦如佛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a06\">0388a06</span><p class=\"lg\">是故我於世間解，<caesura/>今得供養應供者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a07\">0388a07</span><p class=\"lg\">既無眾生亦無苦，<caesura/>是故無有可救度，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a08\">0388a08</span><p class=\"lg\">已得遣除心憂悶，<caesura/>便獲欣喜大踊悅。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a09\">0388a09</span><p class=\"lg\">如是佛教不思議，<caesura/>我等已得如實知，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a10\">0388a10</span><p class=\"lg\">是故我今供養佛，<caesura/>願得如來無上智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a11\">0388a11</span><p class=\"lg\">佛於諸趣不見苦，<caesura/>涅槃亦復不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a12\">0388a12</span><p class=\"lg\">增上棄捨於生死，<caesura/>以此饒益諸世間。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a13\">0388a13</span><p class=\"lg\">無苦無趣無眾生，<caesura/>亦無涅槃而可依，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a14\">0388a14</span><p class=\"lg\">如是得知佛法已，<caesura/>是故我等今供養。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a15\">0388a15</span><p class=\"lg\">佛<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388002\">具＝見【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388002\">具【大】，見【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0388002\"><p class=\"lg\">具</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】 【聖】\">見</rdg></app>慈悲及喜捨，<caesura/>轉為世間常演說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a16\">0388a16</span><p class=\"lg\">而復不見有眾生，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388003\">得住於四無量心＝得依住於四無量【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388003\">得住於四無量心【大】，得依住於四無量【聖】</span><app n=\"0388003\"><p class=\"lg\">得住於四無量心</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">得依住於四無量</rdg></app>。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a17\">0388a17</span><p class=\"lg\">不見有其放逸者，<caesura/>亦復不見不放逸，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a18\">0388a18</span><p class=\"lg\">如是知佛教法已，<caesura/>我今供養大導師。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a19\">0388a19</span><p class=\"lg\">於身離身無上士，<caesura/>觀身畢竟不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a20\">0388a20</span><p class=\"lg\">雖然亦非不<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388004\">有說＝說念【三】【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388004\">有說【大】，說念【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0388004\"><p class=\"lg\">有說</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【聖】\">說念</rdg></app>，<caesura/>而說有念失念者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a21\">0388a21</span><p class=\"lg\">善逝常說修學念，<caesura/>所謂觀身正念處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a22\">0388a22</span><p class=\"lg\">我等如是知佛法，<caesura/>今得供養救度者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a23\">0388a23</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊觀受不可得，<caesura/>以受無有體性故，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a24\">0388a24</span><p class=\"lg\">亦復觀察於受者，<caesura/>畢竟無其真實性。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a25\">0388a25</span><p class=\"lg\">又復觀彼修念者，<caesura/>究竟亦復不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a26\">0388a26</span><p class=\"lg\">我等如是知佛<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388005\">性＝法【三】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388005\">性【大】，法【宋】【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0388005\"><p class=\"lg\">性</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】\">法</rdg></app>，<caesura/>今得供養天人師。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a27\">0388a27</span><p class=\"lg\">觀心及以心數法，<caesura/>畢竟無體不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a28\">0388a28</span><p class=\"lg\">亦復不見有修念，<caesura/>及以正住念處者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388a29\">0388a29</span><p class=\"lg\">佛說念與心和合，<caesura/>樂求解脫應修學，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b01\">0388b01</span><p class=\"lg\">我等如是知佛教，<caesura/>今得供養正遍知。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b02\">0388b02</span><p class=\"lg\">如來不見有諸法，<caesura/>亦復不見修法者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b03\">0388b03</span><p class=\"lg\">大聖所說修習念，<caesura/>彼念亦復性自空。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b04\">0388b04</span><p class=\"lg\">復說念與法和合，<caesura/>欲求解脫應當修，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b05\">0388b05</span><p class=\"lg\">我等如是知佛法，<caesura/>今得供養一切智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b06\">0388b06</span><p class=\"lg\">念處一尚不可得，<caesura/>何況而復有三四，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b07\">0388b07</span><p class=\"lg\">所謂於彼念住處，<caesura/>彼諸念處皆悉無。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b08\">0388b08</span><p class=\"lg\">是故真求不可得，<caesura/>畢竟無受苦樂者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b09\">0388b09</span><p class=\"lg\">我等如是知聖教，<caesura/>今得供養佛世尊。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b10\">0388b10</span><p class=\"lg\">牟尼所說四正勤，<caesura/>若有比丘專修習，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b11\">0388b11</span><p class=\"lg\">斯即能為解脫路，<caesura/>當得出於生死海。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b12\">0388b12</span><p class=\"lg\">而無解脫無縛者，<caesura/>無佛無教及菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b13\">0388b13</span><p class=\"lg\">然復不壞假名用，<caesura/>是故我今供大聖。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b14\">0388b14</span><p class=\"lg\">佛說四種如意足，<caesura/>勝妙安隱解脫道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b15\">0388b15</span><p class=\"lg\">寂靜諸根眾生輩，<caesura/>修行此道得涅槃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b16\">0388b16</span><p class=\"lg\">如意及足修行者，<caesura/>真實觀察不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b17\">0388b17</span><p class=\"lg\">而非斷絕示有作，<caesura/>智慧境界不可見。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b18\">0388b18</span><p class=\"lg\">如是世尊教法中，<caesura/>我等於此皆悉知，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b19\">0388b19</span><p class=\"lg\">其心清淨無垢穢，<caesura/>皆得遠離諸疑惑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b20\">0388b20</span><p class=\"lg\">以斯即為上供養，<caesura/>供養堪受勝供者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b21\">0388b21</span><p class=\"lg\">是故妙智無倫<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388006\">匹＝返【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388006\">匹【大】，返【聖】</span><app n=\"0388006\"><p class=\"lg\">匹</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">返</rdg></app>，<caesura/>我今悉得修供養。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b22\">0388b22</span><p class=\"lg\">世間解者說五根，<caesura/>出世能趣解脫道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b23\">0388b23</span><p class=\"lg\">慎莫放逸常勤修，<caesura/>是為趣向涅槃路。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b24\">0388b24</span><p class=\"lg\">無根及以修根者，<caesura/>亦無解脫及脫者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b25\">0388b25</span><p class=\"lg\">我等於此悉無疑，<caesura/>是故今得供養佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b26\">0388b26</span><p class=\"lg\">導師所說五種力，<caesura/>非邪能趣涅槃城，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b27\">0388b27</span><p class=\"lg\">此能盡滅煩惱縛，<caesura/>令諸縛者得解脫。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b28\">0388b28</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸力體性自空，<caesura/>煩惱及佛皆亦無，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388b29\">0388b29</span><p class=\"lg\">我等於此無疑慮，<caesura/>是故今得供如來。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c01\">0388c01</span><p class=\"lg\">大仙所說七種善，<caesura/>菩提分法最勝道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c02\">0388c02</span><p class=\"lg\">能解一切眾生縛，<caesura/>趣向涅槃大正路。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c03\">0388c03</span><p class=\"lg\">無有繫縛及解脫，<caesura/>亦無受縛得脫者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c04\">0388c04</span><p class=\"lg\">我等於斯無疑惑，<caesura/>是故今得供養佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c05\">0388c05</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊說此八正路，<caesura/>顯示一切諸群生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c06\">0388c06</span><p class=\"lg\">是諸煩惱苦之本，<caesura/>修學聖道能斷除。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c07\">0388c07</span><p class=\"lg\">斯等二法離對治，<caesura/>所謂聖路及煩惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c08\">0388c08</span><p class=\"lg\">諸天於此悉無疑，<caesura/>故今供養應供者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c09\">0388c09</span><p class=\"lg\">修奢摩他及舍那，<caesura/>斯道能盡諸苦邊，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c10\">0388c10</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388007\">令＝尒【宋】【宮】，示【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388007\">令【大】，尒【宋】【宮】，示【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0388007\"><p class=\"lg\">令</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【宮】\">尒</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">示</rdg></app>受諸苦習氣垢，<caesura/>世尊曠劫已蕩除。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c11\">0388c11</span><p class=\"lg\">奢摩他及舍那果，<caesura/>是等一切皆悉空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c12\">0388c12</span><p class=\"lg\">天眾於此離疑網，<caesura/>是故我等今供養。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c13\">0388c13</span><p class=\"lg\">佛說不淨治貪欲，<caesura/>慈心對治於瞋恚，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c14\">0388c14</span><p class=\"lg\">毘婆舍那癡對治，<caesura/>如來顯示諸眾生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c15\">0388c15</span><p class=\"lg\">斯皆無作無暫停，<caesura/>是故無垢亦無淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c16\">0388c16</span><p class=\"lg\">我等<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388008\">於＝如【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388008\">於【大】，如【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0388008\"><p class=\"lg\">於</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">如</rdg></app>是悉無疑，<caesura/>常樂供養大導師。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c17\">0388c17</span><p class=\"lg\">如來所說十不善，<caesura/>斯等名之為業道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c18\">0388c18</span><p class=\"lg\">殺生偷盜及邪<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388009\">淫＝婬【宋】【元】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0388009\">淫【大】，婬【宋】【元】【宮】</span><app n=\"0388009\"><p class=\"lg\">淫</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【宮】\">婬</rdg></app>，<caesura/>妄語兩舌與惡口，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c19\">0388c19</span><p class=\"lg\">綺語貪欲及瞋恚，<caesura/>最後第十名邪見，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c20\">0388c20</span><p class=\"lg\">佛說此等為不善，<caesura/>是諸眾生惡業道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c21\">0388c21</span><p class=\"lg\">既無眾生亦無害，<caesura/>自餘九業亦如是，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c22\">0388c22</span><p class=\"lg\">無有對治諸善惡，<caesura/>以彼自性空寂故。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c23\">0388c23</span><p class=\"lg\">然復非無十力教，<caesura/>以其不壞法體性，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c24\">0388c24</span><p class=\"lg\">我於佛慧亦不疑，<caesura/>是故今供無上智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c25\">0388c25</span><p class=\"lg\">若有修此如來法，<caesura/>是人即為真佛子，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c26\">0388c26</span><p class=\"lg\">彼人處處皆受樂，<caesura/>恒常遠離諸苦惱。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c27\">0388c27</span><p class=\"lg\">如是善逝勝智慧，<caesura/>安隱引導諸群生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c28\">0388c28</span><p class=\"lg\">我等於此離疑心，<caesura/>今悉供養應供者。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0388c29\">0388c29</span><p>爾時遍淨諸天偈讚佛已，咸皆默然却住一\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a01\">0389a01</span>面。爾時世尊見彼天眾默然而住，及知彼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a02\">0389a02</span>天深信心已而現微笑。爾時慧命馬勝以偈\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a03\">0389a03</span>問曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a04\">0389a04</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「今佛世尊最勝智，<caesura/>為利世間現微笑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a05\">0389a05</span><p class=\"lg\">十力世雄超一切，<caesura/>而能化伏諸大眾。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a06\">0389a06</span><p class=\"lg\">善解諸法大導師，<caesura/>所現微笑非無因，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a07\">0389a07</span><p class=\"lg\">心無所乏世間解，<caesura/>唯願解說微笑義。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a08\">0389a08</span><p class=\"lg\">此諸大眾皆一心，<caesura/>無其亂想住正念，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a09\">0389a09</span><p class=\"lg\">喜心瞻仰功德山，<caesura/>唯樂聽聞恭敬住。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a10\">0389a10</span><p class=\"lg\">於佛自在大論師，<caesura/>若得聞說必欣喜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a11\">0389a11</span><p class=\"lg\">善解諸法決定智，<caesura/>當得作佛導群生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a12\">0389a12</span><p class=\"lg\">若人於佛生淨信，<caesura/>必成大智世間最，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a13\">0389a13</span><p class=\"lg\">測知微妙甘露句，<caesura/>是人能觀於十方。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a14\">0389a14</span><p class=\"lg\">誰於未來世劫中，<caesura/>當得作佛愍世間？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a15\">0389a15</span><p class=\"lg\">微妙言辭大導師，<caesura/>唯願說彼令眾喜。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a16\">0389a16</span><p class=\"lg\">若於聖雄沙門所，<caesura/>生其敬信尊重心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a17\">0389a17</span><p class=\"lg\">亦住正法生信慧，<caesura/>一切諸魔不能動。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a18\">0389a18</span><p class=\"lg\">若能生信得決定，<caesura/>即是佛子從心生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a19\">0389a19</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0389001\">唯＝惟【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0389001\">唯【大】，惟【明】</span><app n=\"0389001\"><p class=\"lg\">唯</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">惟</rdg></app>願世尊演說<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0389002\">彼＝法【元】【明】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0389002\">彼【大】，法【元】【明】【聖】</span><app n=\"0389002\"><p class=\"lg\">彼</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】 【聖】\">法</rdg></app>，<caesura/>以是大眾得除疑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a20\">0389a20</span><p class=\"lg\">若有於其眾生所，<caesura/>慈心普覆遍世間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a21\">0389a21</span><p class=\"lg\">智慧堅固當成佛，<caesura/>便得安住一切智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a22\">0389a22</span><p class=\"lg\">百福莊嚴無上士，<caesura/>唯願開演除疑網，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a23\">0389a23</span><p class=\"lg\">誰欲受持世尊法，<caesura/>如來為其現微笑？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a24\">0389a24</span><p class=\"lg\">願得聞佛善巧說，<caesura/>具八功德微妙音，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a25\">0389a25</span><p class=\"lg\">先自得趣於善道，<caesura/>後能引導諸群生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a26\">0389a26</span><p class=\"lg\">如是善逝微妙法，<caesura/>佛子得住於彼中，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a27\">0389a27</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊佛種不斷絕，<caesura/>必得久住於世間。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a28\">0389a28</span><p>爾時世尊即以偈答慧命馬勝言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389a29\">0389a29</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「馬勝汝今問笑光，<caesura/>我為利益諸世間，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b01\">0389b01</span><p class=\"lg\">汝獲福德稱其心，<caesura/>斯福無量不可盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b02\">0389b02</span><p class=\"lg\">妙士乃能應時問，<caesura/>以是大利諸眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b03\">0389b03</span><p class=\"lg\">汝及一切大眾等，<caesura/>欣喜一心聽我說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b04\">0389b04</span><p class=\"lg\">斯等遍淨諸天眾，<caesura/>於我法中悉無疑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b05\">0389b05</span><p class=\"lg\">一切欣喜淨信心，<caesura/>以偈讚頌我功德。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b06\">0389b06</span><p class=\"lg\">此天曾於過去世，<caesura/>供養千億那由佛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b07\">0389b07</span><p class=\"lg\">亦於彼佛問斯義，<caesura/>一切法中得無疑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b08\">0389b08</span><p class=\"lg\">由彼往昔因緣故，<caesura/>今以偈頌讚歎我，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b09\">0389b09</span><p class=\"lg\">亦復淨心當讚歎，<caesura/>賢劫一切諸如來。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b10\">0389b10</span><p class=\"lg\">當於優波羅劫中，<caesura/>成佛大力那羅延，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b11\">0389b11</span><p class=\"lg\">教化不思那由眾，<caesura/>引導入於涅槃城。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b12\">0389b12</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸大仙成佛時，<caesura/>所得名稱甚微妙，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b13\">0389b13</span><p class=\"lg\">我今為汝說彼佛，<caesura/>一心寂靜善諦聽。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b14\">0389b14</span><p class=\"lg\">同其劫中悉作佛，<caesura/>號曰法幢等正覺，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b15\">0389b15</span><p class=\"lg\">咸皆救度不思議，<caesura/>那由他眾入涅槃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b16\">0389b16</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸如來滅度已，<caesura/>焚身廣布諸舍利，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b17\">0389b17</span><p class=\"lg\">以此舍利皆起塔，<caesura/>遍滿佛剎如散花。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b18\">0389b18</span><p class=\"lg\">爾時一切佛舍利，<caesura/>各各皆悉廣流布，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b19\">0389b19</span><p class=\"lg\">彼佛一一涅槃後，<caesura/>咸皆饒益於世間。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b20\">0389b20</span><p class=\"lg\">不思那由眾生輩，<caesura/>供養彼佛舍利已，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b21\">0389b21</span><p class=\"lg\">當得甘露妙涅槃，<caesura/>三世諸佛之所讚。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b22\">0389b22</span><p class=\"lg\">若有稱彼諸佛名，<caesura/>所獲微妙勝善根，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b23\">0389b23</span><p class=\"lg\">當得成就有學道，<caesura/>值佛轉獲殊勝果。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b24\">0389b24</span><p class=\"lg\">猶如無量難思<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0389003\">眾＝議【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0389003\">眾【大】，議【聖】</span><app n=\"0389003\"><p class=\"lg\">眾</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">議</rdg></app>，<caesura/>皆於我所種善根，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b25\">0389b25</span><p class=\"lg\">欣喜信樂清淨心，<caesura/>當得值遇彌勒佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b26\">0389b26</span><p class=\"lg\">如是彼佛聲聞眾，<caesura/>從佛復至諸佛所，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b27\">0389b27</span><p class=\"lg\">常得值佛入眾會，<caesura/>皆由供養彼舍利。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b28\">0389b28</span><p class=\"lg\">得聞如斯佛語已，<caesura/>一切大眾生希有，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389b29\">0389b29</span><p class=\"lg\">勝<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0389004\">妙＝如【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0389004\">妙【大】，如【聖】</span><app n=\"0389004\"><p class=\"lg\">妙</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】\">如</rdg></app>功德有威神，<caesura/>遍淨諸天清信士，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389c01\">0389c01</span><p class=\"lg\">及諸大眾普欣喜，<caesura/>悉皆流注向菩提，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389c02\">0389c02</span><p class=\"lg\">得知如來大勢力，<caesura/>咸各頂禮世尊足。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0389c03\">0389c03</span><cb:juan n=\"068\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第六十八</cb:jhead></cb:juan></cb:div>\r\n</cb:div></body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}